From e718fa61771ef370ed6b19f19791c375fc6a0e70 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 11:35:36 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: Psynergy and Djinn counters built like the shops' Buy
 counter

ArenaShop_Run (shop bank) draws the stock as one row of icons with price tags,
seven to a page with page arrows, the hand cursor over one, a name and price
window at the left, the coins at the right and the description along the
bottom, after Shop_SelectBuy. Psynergy icons are the ability icons; Djinn are
the animated element figures, the chosen one larger. It replaces the overlay's
grid screens. The weapons choice uses the Attack icon, as the Equip icon did
not draw. The shop bank outgrew its slot, so bank 07 starts 0x1000 later.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
