-/// The purchase screen for Psynergy and for Djinn: icons and names in columns,
-/// rows and pages, one character's. The D-pad moves (Left and Right by one,
-/// Up and Down by a row), L and R turn the page, A buys, B leaves. The Djinn
-/// icons are animated figures, made when the page changes and placed every
